---
import { getLocaleFromUrl } from '../i18n';
const locale = getLocaleFromUrl(Astro.url);
const text = locale === 'zh-TW'
  ? '十年下來，我在很多不同情境寫過系統 — 政府、IoT、醫療、SaaS。讓我最有感的不是規模最大的那個，是 WiSide：一個我從零單獨寫出的群眾流量平台。到 2021 年它跑在全台 300+ 台 scanner 上。兩度經長期共事與合作關係獲邀加入新創核心團隊（Taiwan Data Science Co.、Cedars Digital），我把這當作「值得一起工作」的訊號。'
  : "Ten years in, I've built systems in a lot of different contexts — government, IoT, healthcare, SaaS. The work that sticks with me most isn't the biggest in scale. It's WiSide, a crowd intelligence platform I wrote alone from scratch. By 2021 it was running on 300+ scanners across Taiwan. Twice I've been invited into founding-engineer roles through long-term professional relationships — I take that as a decent signal that I'm someone people want to keep working with.";
---
<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6">About</h2>
  <p class="max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">{text}</p>
</section>
